# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout for every
# platform. This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: docs/CUS-reader-single-file.html
# pins SHA-256 hashes of its own inline script and style in its
# Content-Security-Policy, and any newline rewriting invalidates them, which
# blocks the entire page with nothing but a console message.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the generated bundle: never let git touch its bytes.
docs/CUS-reader-single-file.html -text
